        "pageid": 68833918,
        "ns": 0,
        "title": "Blade & Sorcery",
        "extract": "Blade & Sorcery is a 2021 virtual reality sandbox game developed and published by French video game studio WarpFrog. Created in Unity, the game features physics-based combat and interaction with the environment. It was initially released in early access on December 11, 2018, for Microsoft Windows (PCVR). The early access version of the game for the Meta Quest 2, and PICO 4, Blade & Sorcery: Nomad, which was released later, on November 4, 2021. Blade & Sorcery left early access for Windows on June 17, 2024, and Blade & Sorcery: Nomad left early access on October 28, 2024.",
